│                                                                              │
│  ── General ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│         ?  help                                                              │
│         :  command palette                                                   │
│         q  close, or quit at the root                                        │
│       esc  back out one level                                                │
│    ctrl+c  cancel the running command, else quit                             │
│         u  undo                                                              │
│    ctrl+r  redo                                                              │
│    ctrl+l  reload from the source                                            │
│       tab  next pane                                                         │
│         !  shell in the repository root                                      │
│         K  what is this                                                      │
│         Y  yank a reference                                                  │
│        gm  messages and the last failure                                     │
│                                                                              │
│  ── Move ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│        gg  top                                                               │
│         G  bottom                                                            │
│    j/down  down a line                                                       │
│      k/up  up a line                                                         │
│    ctrl+d  half a page down                                                  │
│    ctrl+u  half a page up                                                    │
│         @  jump to the working copy                                          │
│                                                                              │
│  ── Find ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│         /  search                                                            │
│                                                                              │
│  ── Read ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│         H  choose the round to compare against                               │
│         I  outline                                                           │
│                                                                              │
│  ── Jump ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│        ]r  next round                                                        │
│        [r  previous round                                                    │
│                                                                              │
│  ── Look ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│     enter  diff the revision                                                 │
│         p  dock the diff beside the log, following the cursor                │
│         l  files in the revision                                             │
│         =  diff against another revision                                     │
│                                                                              │
│  ── Rewrite ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│         n  new on the revision (two or more checked: a merge)                │
│         e  edit                                                              │
│         E  edit the revision's content in the diff editor                    │
│         d  describe                                                          │
│         D  describe in $EDITOR                                               │
│         c  commit @: describe it and start a new one                         │
│         S  split                                                             │
│         a  abandon                                                           │
│         A  absorb into the revisions that last touched each line             │
│         x  resolve the conflict                                              │
│         X  converge divergent changes                                        │
│         |  parallelize the checked revisions                                 │
│     space  check for a batch action                                          │
│         B  bisect between the two checked revisions                          │
│                                                                              │
│  ── Pick where it goes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│         N  new, choosing where it goes                                       │
│         s  squash, choosing where into                                       │
│         y  duplicate, choosing where (enter: in place)                       │
│         r  rebase, choosing where                                            │
│         R  restore content from another revision (the parent: discard)       │
│                                                                              │
│  ── Repository ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │
│         o  op log, with the log as it stood at each operation                │
│        [o  the log one operation back, read-only                             │
│        ]o  the log one operation forward                                     │
│         f  fetch                                                             │
│         P  push the revision's bookmarks                                     │
│        bb  bookmarks: the list                                               │
│        bc  create a bookmark here                                            │
│         L  edit the revset                                                   │
│        gh  forge pane: pull requests and CI                                  │
│        gw  workspaces                                                        │
│                                                                              │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                